---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="CheckMyCoach v2.2" description="Controlled offline evaluation on one fixed 40-case corpus">
  <div class="container-content py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="badge badge-gold">Controlled Offline Evaluation</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">v2.2</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">Verified: 2026-08-02</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="mb-4">CheckMyCoach</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-8">
        A four-stage research prototype—route, diagnose, correct, validate—evaluated descriptively on one fixed 40-case constructed fitness-advice corpus.
      </p>

      <div class="card-static mb-6 border-l-4 border-[var(--color-primary)]">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Final claim boundary</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
          These results describe one offline execution. They do not establish system superiority, validated detection, equivalence between baselines, deployment effectiveness, or human/user effects.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">36/40</div>
          <div class="text-[0.55rem] font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)] uppercase">Generic Removal</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">36/40</div>
          <div class="text-[0.55rem] font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)] uppercase">Generic + Oracle</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">12/40</div>
          <div class="text-[0.55rem] font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)] uppercase">CMC End-to-End</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center">
          <div class="font-display text-xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">0/40</div>
          <div class="text-[0.55rem] font-mono text-[var(--color-text-muted)] uppercase">CMC All-check Pass</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-static mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-[1.1rem] mb-3">Pipeline trace</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] list-decimal list-inside">
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">M1 routing:</strong> 15/40 cases were routed, all for numerical specificity.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">M3 correction:</strong> all 15 routed cases returned a correction.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">M4 validation:</strong> 12/15 corrections passed the pipeline's checks and removed the prespecified targeted failure.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">End to end:</strong> 12/40 cases achieved targeted-failure removal; none passed every evaluation check.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="card-static mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-[1.1rem] mb-3">Baseline interpretation</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
          Generic and Generic+Oracle each removed the targeted failure in 36/40 cases and made identical case-level targeted-removal decisions in this execution. That observation is not an equivalence result and does not show that oracle information has no value.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="https://github.com/GBX-Max1220/CheckMyCoach" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">View code</a>
        <a href="/demo/checkmycoach/" class="btn">Pipeline demo</a>
        <a href="/research/building-trustworthy-ai/" class="link-arrow self-center">← Back to trustworthy AI</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
